#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:4
msgid "Comparing Simulations Between Isaac Gym and Isaac Lab"
msgstr "比较 Isaac Gym 和 Isaac Lab 之间的仿真"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:7
msgid ""
"When migrating simulations from Isaac Gym to Isaac Lab, it is sometimes "
"helpful to compare the simulation configurations in Isaac Gym and Isaac "
"Lab to identify differences between the two setups. There may be "
"differences in how default values are interpreted, how the importer "
"treats certain hierarchies of bodies, and how values are scaled. The only"
" way to be certain that two simulations are equivalent in the eyes of "
"PhysX is to record a simulation trace of both setups and compare them by "
"inspecting them side-by-side. This approach works because PhysX is the "
"same underlying engine for both Isaac Gym and Isaac Lab, albeit with "
"different versions."
msgstr "当从 Isaac Gym 迁移仿真到 Isaac Lab 时，有时需要比较 Isaac Gym 和 Isaac Lab 中的仿真配置以识别两个设置之间的差异。默认值的解释方式、导入器对某些刚体层次结构的处理方式以及值的缩放方式可能存在差异。确保两个仿真在 PhysX 看来是等效的唯一方法是记录两个设置的仿真轨迹，并通过并排检查来比较它们。这种方法之所以有效，是因为 PhysX 是 Isaac Gym 和 Isaac Lab 的共同底层引擎，尽管版本不同。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:17
msgid "Recording to PXD2 in Isaac Gym Preview Release"
msgstr "在 Isaac Gym Preview Release 中录制为 PXD2 格式"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:19
msgid ""
"Simulation traces in Isaac Gym can be recorded using the built-in PhysX "
"Visual Debugger (PVD) file output feature. Set the operating system "
"environment variable ``GYM_PVD_FILE`` to the desired output file path; "
"the ``.pxd2`` file extension will be appended automatically."
msgstr "可以使用内置的 PhysX Visual Debugger (PVD) 文件输出功能在 Isaac Gym 中记录仿真轨迹。将操作系统环境变量 ``GYM_PVD_FILE`` 设置为所需的输出文件路径； ``.pxd2`` 文件扩展名将自动添加。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:23
msgid ""
"For detailed instructions, refer to the tuning documentation included "
"with Isaac Gym:"
msgstr "有关详细说明，请参阅 Isaac Gym 附带的调优文档："

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:31
msgid ""
"This file reference is provided because Isaac Gym does not have its "
"documentation available online."
msgstr "提供此文件引用是因为 Isaac Gym 没有在线文档。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:35
msgid "Recording to OVD in Isaac Lab"
msgstr "在 Isaac Lab 中录制为 OVD 格式"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:37
msgid ""
"To record an OVD simulation trace file in Isaac Lab, you must set the "
"appropriate Isaac Sim Kit arguments. It is important that the "
"``omniPvdOvdRecordingDirectory`` variable is set **before** "
"``omniPvdOutputEnabled`` is set to ``true``."
msgstr "要在 Isaac Lab 中记录 OVD 仿真轨迹文件，必须设置适当的 Isaac Sim Kit 参数。重要的是要在将 ``omniPvdOutputEnabled`` 设置为 ``true`` **之前** 设置 ``omniPvdOvdRecordingDirectory`` 变量。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:47
msgid ""
"This example outputs a series of OVD files to the ``/tmp/myovds/`` "
"directory."
msgstr "此示例将一系列 OVD 文件输出到 ``/tmp/myovds/`` 目录。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:49
msgid ""
"If the ``--kit_args`` argument does not work in your particular setup, "
"you can set the Kit arguments manually by editing the following file "
"directly within the Isaac Sim source code:"
msgstr "如果 ``--kit_args`` 参数在您的特定设置中不起作用，您可以通过直接编辑 Isaac Sim 源代码中的以下文件来手动设置 Kit 参数："

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:56
msgid "Append the following lines after the ``args = []`` block:"
msgstr "在 ``args = []`` 块后添加以下行："

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:65
msgid "Inspecting PXD2 and OVD Files"
msgstr "检查 PXD2 和 OVD 文件"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:67
msgid ""
"By opening the PXD2 file in a PVD viewer and the OVD file in OmniPVD (a "
"Kit extension), you can manually compare the two simulation runs and "
"their respective parameters."
msgstr "通过在 PVD 查看器中打开 PXD2 文件并在 OmniPVD（一个 Kit 扩展）中打开 OVD 文件，您可以手动比较两次仿真运行及其各自的参数。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:70
msgid "**PhysX Visual Debugger (PVD) for PXD2 Files**"
msgstr "**PhysX Visual Debugger (PVD) 用于 PXD2 文件**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:72
msgid "Download the PVD viewer from the NVIDIA Developer Tools page:"
msgstr "从 NVIDIA 开发者工具页面下载 PVD 查看器："

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:74
msgid "`<https://developer.nvidia.com/tools-downloads#?search=PVD>`_"
msgstr "`<https://developer.nvidia.com/tools-downloads#?search=PVD>`_"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:76
msgid ""
"Both version 2 and version 3 of the PVD viewer are compatible with PXD2 "
"files."
msgstr "PVD 查看器的版本 2 和版本 3 都与 PXD2 文件兼容。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:78
msgid "**OmniPVD for OVD Files**"
msgstr "**OmniPVD 用于 OVD 文件**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:80
msgid ""
"To view OVD files, enable the OmniPVD extension in the Isaac Sim "
"application. For detailed instructions, refer to the OmniPVD developer "
"guide:"
msgstr "要查看 OVD 文件，请在 Isaac Sim 应用程序中启用 OmniPVD 扩展。有关详细说明，请参阅 OmniPVD 开发者指南："

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:83
msgid "https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/extensions/ux/source/omni.physx.pvd/docs/dev_guide/physx_visual_debugger.html"
msgstr "https://docs.omniverse.nvidia.com/kit/docs/omni_physics/latest/extensions/ux/source/omni.physx.pvd/docs/dev_guide/physx_visual_debugger.html"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:85
msgid "**Inspecting Contact Gizmos in OmniPVD**"
msgstr "**在 OmniPVD 中检查接触点小部件**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:87
msgid ""
"To inspect contact points between objects, enable the contact gizmos in "
"OmniPVD. Ensure that the simulation frame is set to **PRE** (pre-"
"simulation frames of each simulation step) in the OmniPVD timeline, or "
"set the replay mode to **PRE**. This allows you to visualize contact "
"information before the solver processes each step."
msgstr "要检查对象之间的接触点，请在 OmniPVD 中启用接触点小部件。确保在 OmniPVD 时间轴中将仿真帧设置为 **PRE**（每个仿真步骤的预仿真帧），或将重放模式设置为 **PRE** 。这样可以在求解器处理每个步骤之前可视化接触信息。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:92
msgid "**Comparing PVD and OVD Files**"
msgstr "**比较 PVD 和 OVD 文件**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:94
msgid ""
"Using the PVD viewer and the OmniPVD extension, you can now compare the "
"simulations side-by-side to identify configuration differences. On the "
"left is PVD for PXD2 inspection and on the right is the OmniPVD extension"
" loaded to inspect OVD files."
msgstr "使用 PVD 查看器和 OmniPVD 扩展，您现在可以并排比较仿真以识别配置差异。左侧是用于检查 PXD2 的 PVD，右侧是加载用于检查 OVD 文件的 OmniPVD 扩展。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:102
msgid "Parameters to Verify During Simulation Comparison"
msgstr "仿真比较期间需要验证的参数"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:104
msgid ""
"For PhysX articulations, each attribute is useful to inspect because it "
"reveals how the link or shape will actually behave in contact, under "
"drives, and at constraints. Below, each attribute is expanded with why it"
" matters for debugging and tuning simulations."
msgstr "对于 PhysX 铰接体，每个属性都值得检查，因为它揭示了链节或形状在接触、驱动和约束下的实际行为方式。下面详细说明了每个属性及其对调试和调优仿真的重要性。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:110
msgid "PxArticulationLink"
msgstr "PxArticulationLink（铰接链节）"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:112
msgid ""
"Each link behaves like a rigid body with mass properties, damping, "
"velocity limits, and contact-resolution limits. Inspecting these helps "
"explain stability issues, jitter, and odd responses to forces."
msgstr "每个链节的行为类似于具有质量属性、阻尼、速度限制和接触解析限制的刚体。检查这些有助于解释稳定性问题、抖动和对力的异常响应。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:116
msgid "Mass Properties"
msgstr "质量属性"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:124
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:334
msgid "**Mass**"
msgstr "**质量**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:119
msgid ""
"Determines how strongly the link accelerates under forces and how it "
"shares impulses in collisions and joint constraints."
msgstr "决定链节在力作用下的加速强度，以及它在碰撞和关节约束中如何分担冲量。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:122
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Understand why a link seems \"too heavy\" (barely "
"moves when pushed) or \"too light\" (flies around from small impulses), "
"and to detect inconsistent mass distribution across a chain that can "
"cause unrealistic motion or joint stress."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 理解为什么链节看起来 \"过重\" （被推动时几乎不动）或 \"过轻\" （因小冲量而到处飞），以及检测链条上不一致的质量分布，这可能导致不真实的运动或关节应力。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:130
msgid "**Center of Mass (pose)**"
msgstr "**质心（位姿）**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:127
msgid "Controls where forces effectively act and how the link balances."
msgstr "控制力的有效作用位置以及链节如何平衡。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:129
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* A character or mechanism tips over unexpectedly or "
"feels unbalanced; an offset COM can cause unrealistic torque for the same"
" contact."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 角色或机构意外倾翻或感觉不平衡；偏移的质心会导致相同接触产生不真实的扭矩。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:136
msgid "**Inertia Tensor / Inertia Scale**"
msgstr "**惯性张量 / 惯性缩放**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:133
msgid "Defines rotational resistance about each axis."
msgstr "定义关于每个轴的旋转阻力。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:135
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Links are too easy or too hard to spin relative to "
"their mass, which affects joint drive tuning and impact responses."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 相对于其质量，链节旋转过于容易或困难，这会影响关节驱动调整和冲击响应。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:139
msgid "Damping Properties"
msgstr "阻尼属性"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:145
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:356
msgid "**Linear Damping**"
msgstr "**线性阻尼**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:142
msgid ""
"Models velocity-proportional drag on translation; higher values make "
"links lose linear speed faster."
msgstr "模拟与速度成正比的平移阻力；较高的值使链节更快地失去线性速度。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:144
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Links slide too far (damping too low) or feel "
"\"underwater\" (damping too high), or when articulation energy seems to "
"vanish without obvious contact."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 链节滑动过远（阻尼过低）或感觉 \"在水下\" （阻尼过高），或者当铰接体能量似乎在没有明显接触的情况下消失时。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:151
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:362
msgid "**Angular Damping**"
msgstr "**角阻尼**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:148
msgid ""
"Models drag on rotation; higher values make spinning links slow more "
"quickly."
msgstr "模拟旋转阻力；较高的值使旋转链节更快地减速。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:150
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Links keep spinning after impacts or motor drives (too"
" low), or joints feel \"sticky\" and fail to swing freely under gravity "
"(too high)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 链节在冲击或电机驱动后继续旋转（过低），或者关节感觉 \"粘滞\" 且无法在重力下自由摆动（过高）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:154
msgid "Velocity Properties"
msgstr "速度属性"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:160
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:368
msgid "**Linear Velocity**"
msgstr "**线速度**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:157
msgid "Instantaneous world-space translational velocity of the link."
msgstr "链节在世界空间中的瞬时平移速度。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:159
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Verify whether joint motors, gravity, or contacts are "
"generating expected motion, detect numerical explosions (huge spikes), "
"and correlate with CCD thresholds and max linear velocity clamping."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 验证关节电机、重力或接触是否产生预期运动，检测数值爆炸（巨大峰值），并与CCD阈值和最大线速度钳位关联。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:166
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:374
msgid "**Angular Velocity**"
msgstr "**角速度**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:163
msgid "Instantaneous world-space rotational velocity."
msgstr "世界空间中的瞬时旋转速度。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:165
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Verify joint drives, impacts, or constraints are "
"producing the correct rotation; spot runaway spin that can cause "
"instability or tunneling before clamping takes effect."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 验证关节驱动、冲击或约束是否产生正确的旋转；发现失控旋转，这可能在钳位生效之前导致不稳定或穿透。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:173
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:380
msgid "**Max Linear Velocity**"
msgstr "**最大线速度**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:169
msgid ""
"Upper bound PhysX uses to clamp linear speed before solving, intended to "
"prevent numerical issues from extremely fast motion."
msgstr "PhysX在求解前用于钳制线速度的上限，旨在防止极快运动带来的数值问题。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:172
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects start tunneling or simulations explode at high"
" speeds. If too high, links can move too far in one step; too low, they "
"may appear unnaturally capped like \"speed-limited\" robots."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象开始穿透或仿真在高速时爆炸。如果过高，链节在一步中可能移动过远；过低，它们可能看起来被不自然地限制，像 \"限速\" 机器人。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:179
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:386
msgid "**Max Angular Velocity**"
msgstr "**最大角速度**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:176
msgid ""
"Upper bound for angular speed; PhysX clamps angular velocity similarly to"
" linear velocity."
msgstr "角速度的上限；PhysX 以与线速度类似的方式钳制角速度。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:178
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Links spin unrealistically fast after collisions or "
"drives (value too large), or rotation looks unnaturally limited, "
"especially for wheels or rotors that should rotate quickly (value too "
"small)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 链节在碰撞或驱动后旋转速度不切实际地快（值过大），或者旋转看起来被不自然地限制，特别是对于应该快速旋转的轮子或转子（值过小）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:182
msgid "Contact Resolution Properties"
msgstr "接触解析属性"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:188
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:395
msgid "**Max Depenetration Velocity**"
msgstr "**最大去穿透速度**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:185
msgid ""
"Limits how much corrective velocity the solver may add in one step to "
"resolve penetrations at contacts."
msgstr "限制求解器在一步中可以添加多少校正速度来解决接触处的穿透。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:187
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Overlapping links \"explode\" outward or jitter after "
"starting interpenetrating (too high), or embedded links separate too "
"slowly and appear stuck together (too low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 重叠的链节在开始穿透后向外 \"爆炸\" 或抖动（过高），或嵌入的链节分离过慢并看起来粘在一起（过低）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:196
#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:402
msgid "**Max Contact Impulse**"
msgstr "**最大接触冲量**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:191
msgid ""
"Caps the impulse the solver can apply at contacts; per-body limit, with "
"the actual contact limit being the minimum of the two bodies' values."
msgstr "限制求解器在接触处可以施加的冲量；每个刚体的限制，实际接触限制是两个刚体值中的最小值。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:194
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Contacts feel too soft (bodies interpenetrate deeply "
"or sink into the environment) or too rigid (sharp impulses causing "
"ringing or bouncing), or when tuning \"soft collisions\" like rubber or "
"skin-like surfaces."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 接触感觉太软（刚体深度穿透或沉入环境）或太硬（尖锐冲量导致震铃或反弹），或者在调整 \"软碰撞\" （如橡胶或类皮肤表面）时。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:199
msgid "State and Behavior Flags"
msgstr "状态和行为标志"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:205
msgid "**Kinematic vs Dynamic flag / Disable gravity**"
msgstr "**运动学 vs 动力学标志 / 禁用重力**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:202
msgid ""
"Indicates whether a link is driven kinematically or fully simulated, and "
"whether gravity affects it."
msgstr "指示链节是运动学驱动还是完全仿真，以及重力是否影响它。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:204
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Parts appear frozen, snap directly to poses, or ignore"
" gravity, which can drastically change articulation behavior."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 部件看起来被冻结，直接跳转到位姿，或忽略重力，这可能会大幅改变铰接体行为。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:212
msgid "**Sleep thresholds (linear, angular) and wake counter**"
msgstr "**休眠阈值（线性、角度）和唤醒计数器**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:208
msgid "Control when a link is allowed to go to sleep and stop simulating."
msgstr "控制链节何时允许进入休眠并停止仿真。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:210
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Articulations sleep too early (stopping motion) or "
"never sleep (wasting performance and causing low-amplitude jitter)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 铰接体过早休眠（停止运动）或从不休眠（浪费性能并导致低幅度抖动）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:215
msgid "PxArticulationJoint"
msgstr "PxArticulationJoint（铰接关节）"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:217
msgid ""
"The inbound joint defines relative motion between a link and its parent. "
"Inspecting motion and related parameters explains limits, constraints, "
"and how drives shape articulation pose and stability."
msgstr "入站关节定义链节与其父节点之间的相对运动。检查运动和相关参数可以解释限制、约束以及驱动如何塑造铰接体位姿和稳定性。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:221
msgid "Joint Configuration"
msgstr "关节配置"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:228
msgid "**Motion**"
msgstr "**运动**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:224
msgid ""
"Per-axis setting (locked, limited, free) that defines which degrees of "
"freedom the joint allows and whether ranges are restricted."
msgstr "每轴设置（锁定、限制、自由），定义关节允许哪些自由度以及范围是否受限。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:227
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* A link moves in an unexpected direction (axis wrongly "
"set to free), hits a hard stop sooner or later than expected (limit vs "
"locked), or seems unconstrained because an axis is mistakenly left free."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 链节沿意外方向移动（轴错误地设置为自由），比预期更早或更晚碰到硬停止（限制 vs 锁定），或者由于轴错误地保持自由而看起来不受约束。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:234
msgid "**Joint Type / Axes definition**"
msgstr "**关节类型 / 轴定义**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:231
msgid ""
"Choice of revolute, prismatic, spherical, etc., and the local joint "
"frames that define axes."
msgstr "选择旋转、棱柱、球形等类型，以及定义轴的局部关节框架。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:233
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* A \"hinge\" behaves more like a ball joint or slides "
"unexpectedly; incorrect type or frame alignment easily produces weird "
"motions."
msgstr "*何时检查:* \"铰链\" 表现得更像球关节或意外滑动；不正确的类型或框架对齐很容易产生怪异的运动。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:240
msgid "**Limits (swing, twist, linear)**"
msgstr "**限制（摆动、扭转、线性）**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:237
msgid ""
"Specify allowed angular or linear ranges and often include "
"stiffness/damping."
msgstr "指定允许的角度或线性范围，通常包括刚度/阻尼。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:239
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Joints hyper-extend, clip through geometry, or "
"suddenly snap at boundaries; mis-set limits cause popping and "
"instability."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 关节过度伸展，穿过几何体，或在边界处突然咬合；设置错误的限制会导致弹跳和不稳定。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:243
msgid "Drive Properties"
msgstr "驱动属性"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:249
msgid "**Drive target position (orientation) and target velocity**"
msgstr "**驱动目标位置（方向）和目标速度**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:246
msgid ""
"Desired relative pose and relative velocity that drives the articulation,"
" often using spring-damper models."
msgstr "驱动铰接体的期望相对位姿和相对速度，通常使用弹簧-阻尼器模型。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:248
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Controllers are too slow or overshoot and "
"oscillate—target values and drive parameters must match link mass and "
"inertia."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 控制器太慢或过冲并振荡——目标值和驱动参数必须与链节质量和惯性匹配。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:255
msgid "**Drive stiffness and damping (spring strength, tangential damping)**"
msgstr "**驱动刚度和阻尼（弹簧强度、切向阻尼）**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:252
msgid ""
"Control how aggressively the joint tries to reach the target pose and how"
" much overshoot is damped."
msgstr "控制关节尝试达到目标位姿的激进程度以及过冲的阻尼量。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:254
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Joints buzz or oscillate under load (stiffness high, "
"damping low) or feel unresponsive and \"rubbery\" (stiffness low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 关节在负载下嗡嗡作响或振荡（刚度高、阻尼低）或感觉无响应且 \"橡胶般\" （刚度低）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:261
msgid "**Joint friction / resistance (if configured)**"
msgstr "**关节摩擦 / 阻力（如果配置）**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:258
msgid "Adds resistance even without explicit damping in drives."
msgstr "即使在驱动中没有显式阻尼，也会增加阻力。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:260
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Passive joints keep swinging too long, or appear stuck"
" even without drives."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 被动关节继续摆动时间过长，或者即使没有驱动也看起来被卡住。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:264
msgid "PxShape"
msgstr "PxShape（形状）"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:266
msgid ""
"Shapes attached to links determine collision representation and contact "
"behavior. Even if they are internal in OmniPhysics, their properties have"
" a strong impact on stability, contact timing, and visual alignment."
msgstr "附加到链节的形状决定了碰撞表示和接触行为。即使它们在 OmniPhysics 中是内部的，它们的属性也对稳定性、接触时间和视觉对齐有很强的影响。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:270
msgid "Collision Offsets"
msgstr "碰撞偏移"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:277
msgid "**Rest Offset**"
msgstr "**静止偏移**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:273
msgid ""
"Distance at which two shapes come to rest; sum of their rest offsets "
"defines the separation where they \"settle\"."
msgstr "两个形状静止时的距离；它们的静止偏移之和定义了它们 \"安定\" 的分离距离。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:275
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Graphics and collision appear misaligned (gaps or "
"visible intersections), or sliding over meshes is rough. Small positive "
"offsets can smooth sliding, while zero offset tends to align exactly but "
"may catch on geometry."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 图形和碰撞看起来不对齐（间隙或可见相交），或在网格上滑动粗糙。小的正偏移可以使滑动平滑，而零偏移倾向于精确对齐，但可能会卡在几何体上。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:285
msgid "**Contact Offset**"
msgstr "**接触偏移**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:280
msgid ""
"Distance at which contact generation begins; shapes whose distance is "
"less than the sum of contact offsets generate contacts."
msgstr "接触生成开始的距离；距离小于接触偏移之和的形状会生成接触。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:283
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Contacts appear \"too early\" (objects seem to collide"
" before visually touching, increasing contact count) or \"too late\" "
"(tunneling or jitter). The difference between contact and rest offsets is"
" crucial for predictive, stable contacts."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 接触看起来 \"过早\" （对象在视觉接触前似乎发生碰撞，增加接触计数）或 \"过晚\" （穿透或抖动）。接触偏移和静止偏移之间的差异对于预测性、稳定的接触至关重要。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:288
msgid "Geometry and Materials"
msgstr "几何和材质"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:294
msgid "**Geometry type and dimensions**"
msgstr "**几何类型和尺寸**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:291
msgid "Box, sphere, capsule, convex, mesh, and the associated size parameters."
msgstr "盒子、球体、胶囊、凸面、网格以及相关的尺寸参数。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:293
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Collision footprint does not match the visual "
"mesh—overly large shapes cause premature contacts; small shapes allow "
"visual intersection and change leverage at contacts."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 碰撞轮廓与视觉网格不匹配——过大的形状会导致过早接触；小形状允许视觉相交并改变接触处的杠杆作用。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:300
msgid "**Material(s): friction, restitution, compliance**"
msgstr "**材质：摩擦、恢复、柔度**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:297
msgid "Friction coefficients and restitution define sliding and bounciness."
msgstr "摩擦系数和恢复系数定义滑动和弹性。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:299
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* An articulation foot skids too easily, sticks to the "
"ground, or bounces unexpectedly. Wrong materials can make mechanisms "
"unstable or unresponsive."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 铰接体的脚太容易打滑、粘在地面上或意外反弹。错误的材质会使机构不稳定或无响应。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:303
msgid "Shape Flags"
msgstr "形状标志"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:309
msgid "**Flag for simulation / query / trigger**"
msgstr "**仿真 / 查询 / 触发标志**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:306
msgid ""
"Whether the shape participates in simulation contacts, raycasts only, or "
"trigger events."
msgstr "形状是否参与仿真接触、仅光线投射或触发事件。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:308
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Contacts do not appear (shape set as query only) or "
"triggers unexpectedly create physical collisions."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 接触未出现（形状设置为仅查询）或触发器意外创建物理碰撞。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:316
msgid "**Contact density (CCD flags, if used)**"
msgstr "**接触密度（CCD 标志，如果使用）**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:312
msgid ""
"Continuous collision detection flags affecting how fast-moving links are "
"handled."
msgstr "影响快速移动链节处理方式的连续碰撞检测标志。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:314
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Fast articulation parts tunnel through thin obstacles,"
" or CCD is too aggressive and reduces performance."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 快速铰接部件穿过薄障碍物，或 CCD 过于激进并降低性能。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:319
msgid "PxRigidDynamic"
msgstr "PxRigidDynamic（刚体动力学）"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:321
msgid ""
"``PxRigidDynamic`` is the core simulated rigid body type in PhysX, so "
"inspecting its attributes is crucial for understanding individual object "
"behavior, stability, and performance in the scene. Many attributes mirror"
" ``PxArticulationLink``, but a rigid dynamic is not constrained by "
"articulation joints and can also be used in kinematic mode."
msgstr "``PxRigidDynamic`` 是 PhysX 中的核心仿真刚体类型，因此检查其属性对于理解场景中单个对象的行为、稳定性和性能至关重要。许多属性与 ``PxArticulationLink`` 相似，但刚体动力学不受铰接关节约束，也可以在运动学模式下使用。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:327
msgid "Mass and Mass-Related Properties"
msgstr "质量和质量相关属性"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:330
msgid ""
"Controls translational response to forces and impulses; for the same "
"impulse, lower mass gives higher velocity change."
msgstr "控制对力和冲量的平移响应；对于相同的冲量，较低的质量产生较高的速度变化。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:333
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* An object barely reacts to hits (mass too large) or "
"flies away from small forces (mass too small), or mass ratios between "
"interacting bodies cause overly dominant or easily bullied bodies."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象几乎不对撞击做出反应（质量过大）或因小力而飞走（质量过小），或交互刚体之间的质量比导致过于主导或容易被欺负的刚体。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:340
msgid "**Center of Mass (COM) pose**"
msgstr "**质心 (COM) 位姿**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:337
msgid ""
"Defines where forces effectively act and around which point the body "
"rotates."
msgstr "定义力的有效作用位置以及刚体围绕哪个点旋转。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:339
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects tip over unexpectedly, roll in unintuitive "
"ways, or feel \"unbalanced.\" A COM too high or off-center can cause "
"strong torques from small contacts."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象意外倾翻、以不直观的方式滚动或感觉 \"不平衡\" 。质心过高或偏离中心可能会导致小接触产生强扭矩。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:347
msgid "**Inertia tensor / inertia scaling**"
msgstr "**惯性张量 / 惯性缩放**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:343
msgid ""
"Determines resistance to angular acceleration around each axis for a "
"given torque."
msgstr "确定给定扭矩下围绕每个轴的角加速度阻力。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:345
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies are too easy or too hard to spin (e.g., a large"
" object spinning quickly from small hits), or when anisotropic behavior "
"is needed (e.g., wheels that spin easily around one axis but resist "
"others)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体旋转过于容易或困难（例如，大物体因小撞击而快速旋转），或者当需要各向异性行为时（例如，轮子围绕一个轴容易旋转但抵抗其他轴）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:350
msgid "Damping and Velocity Limits"
msgstr "阻尼和速度限制"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:353
msgid "Adds velocity-proportional drag on translation."
msgstr "在平移上添加与速度成正比的阻力。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:355
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies slide too far or for too long (damping too low)"
" or appear as if moving through thick fluid (damping too high), and when "
"scenes lose energy faster than friction alone would suggest."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体滑动过远或过长时间（阻尼过低）或看起来像在浓稠液体中移动（阻尼过高），以及当场景比仅靠摩擦所暗示的更快地失去能量时。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:359
msgid "Adds drag on rotation, reducing angular velocity over time."
msgstr "增加旋转阻力，随时间降低角速度。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:361
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Spinning objects never settle or spin unrealistically "
"long (too low), or they stop rotating almost immediately after impact or "
"motor impulses (too high)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 旋转物体从不稳定或旋转时间不切实际地长（过低），或者它们在冲击或电机冲量后几乎立即停止旋转（过高）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:365
msgid "Current translational velocity used by the integrator and solver."
msgstr "积分器和求解器使用的当前平移速度。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:367
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Debug impulses, gravity, or applied forces to see "
"whether the body is accelerating as expected; detect spikes or non-"
"physical jumps in speed."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 调试冲量、重力或施加的力，以查看刚体是否按预期加速；检测速度中的尖峰或非物理跳跃。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:371
msgid "Current rotational speed around each axis."
msgstr "围绕每个轴的当前旋转速度。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:373
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Rotations look jittery, explode numerically, or fail "
"to respond to applied torques. High values relative to time step and "
"object scale can indicate instability."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 旋转看起来抖动、数值爆炸或未能响应施加的扭矩。相对于时间步长和对象比例的高值可能表示不稳定。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:377
msgid "Upper bound used to clamp linear velocity before solving."
msgstr "求解前用于钳制线速度的上限。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:379
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Very fast bodies cause tunneling or simulation "
"explosions (value too high), or they appear unnaturally \"speed-"
"limited,\" especially projectiles or debris in high-energy scenes (value "
"too low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 非常快的刚体导致穿透或仿真爆炸（值过高），或者它们看起来被不自然地 \"限速\" ，特别是高能场景中的抛射物或碎片（值过低）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:383
msgid "Upper bound used to clamp angular velocity."
msgstr "用于钳制角速度的上限。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:385
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Thin or small bodies spin so fast they destabilize the"
" scene (value too high), or spinning elements such as wheels, propellers,"
" or debris appear artificially capped (value too low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 薄或小的刚体旋转如此之快以至于它们破坏场景的稳定性（值过高），或者旋转元素如轮子、螺旋桨或碎片看起来被人为限制（值过低）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:389
msgid "Contact Resolution and Impulses"
msgstr "接触解析和冲量"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:392
msgid ""
"Limits the corrective velocity the solver may introduce in one step to "
"resolve interpenetrations."
msgstr "限制求解器在一步中可能引入的校正速度以解决互穿。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:394
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Intersecting bodies \"explode\" apart or jitter "
"violently after overlap (too high), or separate very slowly and appear "
"stuck or interpenetrated for several frames (too low)."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 相交的刚体在重叠后 \"爆炸\" 分开或剧烈抖动（过高），或者非常缓慢地分离并在几帧中看起来卡住或互穿（过低）。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:398
msgid ""
"Caps the impulse that can be applied at contacts involving this body; the"
" effective limit is the minimum between the two bodies, or the dynamic "
"body for static–dynamic contacts."
msgstr "限制涉及此刚体的接触处可以施加的冲量；有效限制是两个刚体之间的最小值，或静态-动态接触中的动态刚体。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:401
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Create softer contacts (lower limit) or very rigid, "
"almost unyielding bodies (high or default limit); objects sink into each "
"other or bounce unrealistically."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 创建更软的接触（较低限制）或非常刚性、几乎不屈服的刚体（高或默认限制）；对象相互沉入或不切实际地反弹。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:405
msgid "Sleep and Activation Behavior"
msgstr "休眠和激活行为"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:411
msgid "**Sleep Threshold**"
msgstr "**休眠阈值**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:408
msgid ""
"Mass-normalized kinetic energy below which a body becomes a candidate for"
" sleeping."
msgstr "质量归一化的动能低于此值时，刚体成为休眠候选。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:410
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies fall asleep too early while they should still "
"move (threshold too high) or constantly jitter and never sleep (threshold"
" too low), which can hurt performance."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体在应该继续移动时过早休眠（阈值过高）或持续抖动且从不休眠（阈值过低），这可能会损害性能。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:417
msgid "**Wake Counter / isSleeping flag**"
msgstr "**唤醒计数器 / isSleeping 标志**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:414
msgid "Internal timer and state indicating whether the body is active."
msgstr "指示刚体是否活动的内部计时器和状态。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:416
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies refuse to wake up on interactions or wake too "
"easily. Bad sleep behavior can make scenes feel \"dead\" or too noisy."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体在交互时拒绝唤醒或过于容易唤醒。不良的休眠行为会使场景感觉 \"死气沉沉\" 或过于嘈杂。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:420
msgid "Kinematic Mode and Locking"
msgstr "运动学模式和锁定"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:428
msgid "**Kinematic Flag (PxRigidBodyFlag::eKINEMATIC)**"
msgstr "**运动学标志 (PxRigidBodyFlag::eKINEMATIC)**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:423
msgid ""
"When set, the body is moved by ``setKinematicTarget`` and ignores forces "
"and gravity, while still affecting dynamic bodies it touches."
msgstr "设置后，刚体通过 ``setKinematicTarget`` 移动并忽略力和重力，同时仍然影响其接触的动态刚体。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:426
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects appear to have infinite mass (pushing others "
"but not reacting) or ignore gravity and impulses. Mismatched expectations"
" here commonly cause odd behavior in characters, moving platforms, or "
"doors."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象似乎具有无限质量（推动其他对象但不做出反应）或忽略重力和冲量。这里的不匹配预期通常会导致角色、移动平台或门的奇怪行为。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:435
msgid "**Rigid Dynamic Lock Flags (PxRigidDynamicLockFlag)**"
msgstr "**刚体动力学锁定标志 (PxRigidDynamicLockFlag)**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:431
msgid ""
"Per-axis linear and angular DOF locks, effectively constraining motion "
"without a joint."
msgstr "每轴线性和角度自由度锁定，有效地在没有关节的情况下约束运动。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:433
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Bodies unexpectedly move in constrained directions "
"(lock not set) or fail to move/rotate where they should (lock set by "
"mistake), especially for 2D-style movement or simple constrained "
"mechanisms."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体意外地在受约束方向上移动（未设置锁定）或在应该移动/旋转的地方无法移动（错误设置锁定），特别是对于 2D 风格的移动或简单的受约束机构。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:441
msgid "**Disable Gravity (PxActorFlag::eDISABLE_GRAVITY)**"
msgstr "**禁用重力 (PxActorFlag::eDISABLE_GRAVITY)**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:438
msgid "Toggles whether the body is affected by scene gravity."
msgstr "切换刚体是否受场景重力影响。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:440
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Objects float in mid-air or drop unexpectedly. A "
"common source of confusion in mixed setups with some gravity-less bodies."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 对象漂浮在半空中或意外掉落。在某些无重力刚体的混合设置中，这是常见的困惑来源。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:444
msgid "Forces and Solver Overrides"
msgstr "力和求解器覆盖"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:450
msgid "**Applied force and torque (accumulated per step)**"
msgstr "**施加的力和扭矩（每步累积）**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:447
msgid "Net forces/torques that will be integrated into velocity."
msgstr "将被积分到速度中的净力/扭矩。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:449
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Debug gameplay forces (thrusters, character pushes, "
"explosions) to see if the expected input is actually reaching the body."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 调试游戏力（推进器、角色推动、爆炸）以查看预期输入是否实际到达刚体。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:457
msgid "**Per-body solver iteration counts (minPositionIters, minVelocityIters)**"
msgstr "**每刚体求解器迭代计数 (minPositionIters, minVelocityIters)**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:453
msgid ""
"Overrides for how many solver iterations this body gets in constraints "
"and contacts."
msgstr "此刚体在约束和接触中获得多少求解器迭代的覆盖。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:455
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Certain bodies (e.g., characters, stacked crates, "
"fragile structures) need higher stability or more accurate stacking. Low "
"iterations can cause jitter and penetration; too high wastes performance."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 某些刚体（例如，角色、堆叠的箱子、脆弱的结构）需要更高的稳定性或更准确的堆叠。低迭代可能导致抖动和穿透；过高会浪费性能。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:460
msgid "Shape-Related Aspects"
msgstr "形状相关方面"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:462
msgid ""
"While not properties of ``PxRigidDynamic`` itself, the shapes attached to"
" it heavily influence behavior."
msgstr "虽然不是 ``PxRigidDynamic`` 本身的属性，但附加到它的形状会严重影响行为。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:468
msgid "**Attached Shapes' Rest and Contact Offsets**"
msgstr "**附加形状的静止和接触偏移**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:465
msgid ""
"Control predictive contact generation and visual separation as described "
"earlier."
msgstr "如前所述，控制预测性接触生成和视觉分离。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:467
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* A dynamic body seems to collide too early/late or "
"appears to float above surfaces or intersect them visually."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 动态刚体似乎碰撞过早/过晚或看起来漂浮在表面上方或与它们视觉相交。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:475
msgid "**Attached Materials (friction, restitution)**"
msgstr "**附加材质（摩擦、恢复）**"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:471
msgid "Define sliding and bounciness for this body's contacts."
msgstr "定义此刚体接触的滑动和弹性。"

#: ../../source/migration/comparing_simulation_isaacgym.rst:473
msgid ""
"*When to inspect:* Rigid dynamics skid, stick, or bounce in unexpected "
"ways. Often the \"behavior issue\" is material configuration rather than "
"mass or damping."
msgstr "*何时检查:* 刚体动力学以意外方式打滑、粘住或反弹。通常 \"行为问题\" 是材质配置而不是质量或阻尼。"

